  "steps": [
    "Grind the slice of whole wheat bread into bread crumbs.",
    "Boil the soya chunks and squeeze out all the water.",
    "In a pan, heat the ghee and sauté the garlic, green chilli and jeera.",
    "Add the onion and corn and sauté until golden brown.",
    "Add the masalas and mix well.",
    "Blend this with the rice flour and soya chunks.",
    "Cut the cheese cube into 4 pieces.",
    "Grease your hands with ghee and shape the mixture into cutlets, stuffing a small piece of cheese into each.",
    "Roll the cutlets in the bread crumbs.",
    "Pan-fry on each side until crispy (this can take 15 minutes on medium-low heat).",
    "For the chutney, blend the dhaniya, Greek yogurt, walnuts, green chilli, garlic, lemon juice, salt and pepper until smooth."
